1
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,350
Perasan tak,
ada teh yang bulat?

2
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:12,733
Assalamualaikum.

3
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:14,083
Awak tahu saya dekat mana?

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,950
Saya dekat Tepak Marketing.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,050
Rupa-rupanya semua
produk Lipton

6
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,350
dibungkus di sini.

7
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:27,650
Siapa peminat teh,
peminat Lipton terutamanya…

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,100
Kita berada di kilang

9
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,650
yang membungkus
teh kegemaran anda.

10
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:33,400
Jom!

11
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,350
Kita mula dekat sini.

12
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:54,500
Kita punya proses,
bahan mentah

13
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,100
kita masuk daripada sebelah,

14
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:00,150
dia akan bawa ke sini
untuk proses blending.

15
00:01:02,433 --> 00:01:04,433
Kita ada uncang-uncang
bulat tu,

16
00:01:04,433 --> 00:01:08,133
output mesin tu
terlampau laju,

17
00:01:08,133 --> 00:01:11,683
satu minit boleh buat
1,000 hingga 1,200 uncang.

18
00:01:12,083 --> 00:01:16,633
Kita dapat pastikan setiap pek
timbangannya betul.

19
00:01:16,733 --> 00:01:19,933
Kita ikut Akta Makanan,

20
00:01:20,033 --> 00:01:24,033
tak boleh kurang daripada
yang dibenarkan.

21
00:01:24,183 --> 00:01:25,733
Berapa, dik, dia punya berat?

22
00:01:27,033 --> 00:01:29,433
252 sampai 253, selalu.

23
00:01:29,483 --> 00:01:32,033
Setiap sejam, kita akan ada
quality control,

24
00:01:32,033 --> 00:01:33,383
cek dari printing.

25
00:01:36,633 --> 00:01:37,933
Kita akan compare dengan

26
00:01:37,933 --> 00:01:39,583
Master Blend
atau Master Sample.

27
00:01:39,763 --> 00:01:41,183
Dengan production sekarang,

28
00:01:41,183 --> 00:01:44,733
match tak dengan
Master Sample.

29
00:01:44,733 --> 00:01:45,833
Hari-hari kena rasa.

30
00:01:46,933 --> 00:01:48,333
Lipton yang dah dibungkus,

31
00:01:48,333 --> 00:01:51,833
40 uncang sepaket,

32
00:01:51,833 --> 00:01:55,833
siap dengan tarikh
akhir penggunaan.

33
00:01:55,983 --> 00:01:58,433
Logo halal pun ada.

34
00:01:59,533 --> 00:02:01,733
Lipton memang nama
yang terkenal.

35
00:02:03,173 --> 00:02:06,633
Dia target hanya
10 tan setahun.

36
00:02:06,733 --> 00:02:08,933
Tapi Alhamdulillah, tahun
pertama kita launch,

37
00:02:08,933 --> 00:02:10,533
dapat 30 tan.

38
00:02:10,533 --> 00:02:11,833
Maksudnya, 3 kali ganda.

39
00:02:13,233 --> 00:02:16,433
Alhamdulillah, kita dah
mencapai 1,400 tan setahun.

